text = "[b]Goal:[/b]
Survive as many [b]Days & Hours[/b] as possible while balancing 4 core resources!

[b]Animations & Visual Feedback:[/b]
• Resource increases trigger a [color=yellow]Yellow Glow[/color]!
• Resource decreases trigger a [color=deep_sky_blue]Blue Glow[/color]!

[b]Insights & Shop Power-Ups:[/b]
• [b]Default:[/b] Drag preview shows affected indicator icons.
• [b]Small Insight:[/b] Displays value change ranges (e.g., +5..15, -10..20).
• [b]Exact Insight:[/b] Displays EXACT delta numbers (e.g., +15, -10).
• [b]Timed Insights:[/b] Active for 3 Decision Blocks!
• Buy Insights in the Shop using persistent [color=gold]Gold Currency[/color] earned from surviving!"

